=2 Walkthrough
* Start the quest by talking to {n:Yurim} at (J-8) in {z:Tavnazian Safehold} on the top floor.

* Choose a reward, then trade the appropriate base item and chip to {n:Yurim}. Be careful as you cannot cancel the quest after making your decision!

* Speak to {n:Yurim} again. You can either go farm the appropriate EX items now or you can trade an {i:Apple Pie|Apple Pie|4413} to Yurim for a hint.
** I'd suggest saving the money and just using the table below.

* Trade the appropriate items to {n:Yurim} to complete the quest and receive your reward.

* Completing the quest once by obtaining any 1 item allows you to trade vices and auras dropped from several HNMs in {p:Lumoria} to {n:Meret} for a reward.

